   encoders and decoders. It follows the reference's algorithms and data
   layout so that it writes the same bytes as macOS's libcompression, with
   one change found by comparing against libcompression: the LZVN match
   finder's hash. github.com/go-compressions/lzfse (BSD 3-Clause), which this
   project used before, informed the Go structure; no code is taken from it.

